'''Chroma Saw''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It resembles a light gray futuristic saw, hence the name. It has a long blade with chromatic streaks and small circular beam lights. Along the edge of the blade are small, bumpy ridges, and the tip of the blade is smooth and curved. The guard is black with a carbon texture, and the handle is light gray with a cutlass style.

==Trivia==
* It is the [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife under the name [[Saw]], which can be found in the same box.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.
*Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/170903610/Intergalactic-Sword Intergalactic Sword], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux.
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it lost a lot of [[value]] due to being [[The Duping Glitch (2021)|duped]].

